### 架构分派模式（`kernel/arch/arch.zig`）

内核代码通过此文件的 `comptime` 分派访问架构相关功能，**禁止**在其他文件中直接 `@import` 架构子目录：

```zig
// kernel/arch/arch.zig
const builtin = @import("builtin");

pub const Arch = switch (builtin.cpu.arch) {
    .x86_64      => @import("x86_64/cpu.zig"),
    .aarch64     => @import("aarch64/cpu.zig"),
    .riscv64     => @import("riscv64/csr.zig"),
    .loongarch64 => @import("loongarch64/csr.zig"),
    else         => @compileError("Unsupported architecture: " ++ @tagName(builtin.cpu.arch)),
};

pub const Paging = switch (builtin.cpu.arch) {
    .x86_64      => @import("x86_64/paging.zig"),
    .aarch64     => @import("aarch64/paging.zig"),
    .riscv64     => @import("riscv64/paging.zig"),
    .loongarch64 => @import("loongarch64/paging.zig"),
    else         => @compileError("Unsupported architecture"),
};
```
